# Trivy ignore file — caddy-waf
#
# The three findings below are embedded in the Caddy 2.11.4 Go binary (usr/bin/caddy).
# No patched Caddy release exists yet: all are fixed in upstream Go dependencies
# (golang.org/x/text v0.39.0, google.golang.org/grpc v1.82.1, golang.org/x/net v0.56.0)
# that land in Caddy >= 2.11.5.
#
# RE-ENABLE when the base image is upgraded to Caddy >= 2.11.5:
# remove these lines (and the CHANGELOG/SECURITY.md known-issues notes).

# CVE-2026-56852 — golang.org/x/text v0.37.0: Denial of Service via invalid UTF-8 input.
# DoS-class only (no RCE); not reachable in this deployment (reverse-proxy only, no templates).
CVE-2026-56852

# GHSA-hrxh-6v49-42gf — google.golang.org/grpc v1.81.0: xDS RBAC and HTTP/2 vulnerabilities.
# gRPC/xDS is not used by Caddy core in this deployment; not reachable.
GHSA-hrxh-6v49-42gf

# CVE-2026-46600 — golang.org/x/net v0.55.0: Denial of Service via invalid DNS record
# parsing (x/net/dns/dnsmessage). DoS-class only; Caddy core and the caddy-dns/cloudflare
# module do not parse raw DNS wire messages in this deployment; not reachable.
CVE-2026-46600
